    {
      "type": "mechanism",
      "text": "Cordyceps contains bioactive compounds such as cordycepin, polysaccharides, and adenosine derivatives. These compounds enhance mitochondrial ATP production, improve oxygen utilization, modulate immune response, and reduce oxidative stress. Neuroprotective actions are mediated by antioxidant and anti-inflammatory pathways, which may support mood and cognition."
